        {
          "text": "Man Yakobo bino bang’ Isak ma won i Mamre, ba Kiriath-arba (ma en e Hebron), ka ma Ibrahim kud Isak gibedo ni umondo i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
